$99,000 each, routed through a shell company based in ██████ before being reinvested in real estate ventures in ███████████████████████ combination of forensic accounting and a nuanced understanding of international banking law enabled our team to build a compelling case against ██████████████████. The court ruled in favor of ███████████████████, ordering the recovery of $100 million and imposing significant penalties on ██████████████████ for their role in the laundering scheme."
